{meta title='Silent in a page', about='With $padAssert off, as here, the asserts render nothing - not even the one on a field that does not exist.'}
{set $total = 42}
<p>Before the asserts.</p>
{assert $total eq 42, 'the cart total'}
{assert $missing gt 0, 'never evaluated'}
<p>After the asserts - nothing between the two paragraphs.</p>
